Package: fastnlcd
Title: Fast Annual NLCD Land Cover Extraction for Polygons
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Noah", "Weidig", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "weidignc@gmail.com")
Description: One function, extract_nlcd(), that returns per-feature land cover
    percent and area from the USGS Annual National Land Cover Database
    (Collection 1.2, 1985-2025). Only the native 30 m tiles each feature
    touches are fetched from the USGS WCS, in parallel, and cached on disk.
    Extraction uses exact coverage fractions via exactextractr and runs in
    spatially sorted chunks so memory stays flat for large layers.
